designed for students, faculty, and visitors.\n\nThis application offers an interactive, high-resolution 360\u00b0 video tour that lets you discover in detail each floor of the building, the layout of study areas, and the full range of available library services.\n\n### \ud83c\udf1f Key Features:\n\n* **Guided 360\u00b0 Tour:** View the different floors and real environments of the central library in immersive video.\n* **Informative Audio Narration:** Descriptive audio in Spanish explaining the function and services of each area.\n* **Intuitive Hand Tracking Navigation:** Interact with the UI and select floors naturally using just your hands.\n* **Educational & Institutional Focus:** A tool created to orient the university community and promote modern technologies.", "short_description": "An immersive virtual reality experience offering an interactive 360\u00b0 tour of the Central Library at the University of San Carlos de Guatemala (USAC). Explore its facilities, levels, and services featuring voice-guided navigation and gesture-based interaction via hand tracking."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LXZWgEzcrwTSRfgxBGtAx3S_HL5ZnMm3/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zentherion", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://biblioteca.usac.edu.gt/biblioteca2023/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es_VE", "es"], "supported_inp